      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Go north, navigate to the centre of the maze. Use the map here as reference.<ul><li>First choice.</li><li>Second choice.</li><li>Third choice.</li><li>Fourth choice.</li><li>Fifth choice.</li><li>Sixth choice.</li></ul>",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "I think Ahrim should go left."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "You'd let someone else be hurt?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "That's no reason to hurt someone else."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "I think Ahrim should be hurt."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Then suffer now so it won't be as bad later."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Think about the innocents Ahrim."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "I think Ahrim should be hurt."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "It's more practical to hurt you."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Sliske won't kill you, he wants you at the end."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "I think Ahrim should be hurt."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Going west gets it over with faster."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "It's the hesitation that makes it worse."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "So make there be only one choice - you."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "I think Ahrim should be hurt."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Don't be weak Ahrim."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Then fight, Ahrim!"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "You'll remember it as a moment of weakness."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "You're Saradomin's holy warrior."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "I think Ahrim should be hurt."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "You're pathetic Ahrim."
